# Every check, before each commit (~4 min): this replaces GitHub CI.
# First the test guard (staged changes need a test, decision 0007), so a missing test fails in a second.
# Then fix and lint the staged files, then lint, typecheck, test, build, size-check and run e2e.
# Skip once with: git commit --no-verify
node scripts/testGuard.mjs
pnpm exec lint-staged
node scripts/checks.mjs
